    "description": "Nestled in the most sheltered \u0026amp; warmest part of pristine Powell Lake, on the Sunshine Coast of S.W. British Columbia, CANADA, historic Rainbow Lodge is an off-grid, boat access only, legacy property featuring 5700' of lakefront \u0026amp; 105 acres of subdividable land. In addition to the timber-frame main lodge (built in 2023), this meticulously constructed \u0026amp; refined turnkey sanctuary consists of 8 outbuildings, including an owner's cabin, 2 large guests cabins, events space, studio, bunkhouse, workshop shed \u0026amp; large storage shed. The infrastructure is state-of-the-art and suitable for commercial usage. The combination of lakefront PRIVACY, warm \u0026amp; pristine water \u0026amp; near-new construction is extremely rare PLUS the Lodge is easily accessible from YVR or by float plane from D/T Vancouver. Detailed brochure available. Serious inquiries only.",
